

Functional Interface:
Interface having exaclty one abstract method but it can have any number of default and static methods, we can invoke lambda
expression by using functional interface

abstract method: jiski body nahi hoti

public interface Parent{
    public void sayHello(); // abstract method
}

public interface Child extends Parent{ // ye bhi functional interface hoga
}

------
lakin agar:-
public interface Child extends Parent{ // abb ye functional interface NAHI hoga, kyuki child ke andar ab 2 abstract method h.
    public void sayBye();
}





